<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-ENGLAND 383 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS VS NZ.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 383 ALL OUT IN 1ST INNINGS VS NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were all out for 383 in their first innings 40 minutes after tea in reply to New Zealand's 124 on the third day of the second test on Saturday.</p>
<p>England hold a first innings lead of 259.</p>
<p>Scores:  </p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 124 (D. Patel 45, D. Gough 5-40, A. Caddick 4-45).</p>
<p>England first innings 383 (N. Hussain 64, G. Thorpe 108, J. Crawley 56, A. Stewart 52, S. Doull 5-75).</p>
</text>
